    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/8607be843237aa838829097727cfe9c0.poster.avif?t=1755426511\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/8607be843237aa838829097727cfe9c0.webp?t=1755426511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAGER</strong> is a 1-bit 3D Kafkaesque Psychological Horror game set in a 90s office building.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal mix of humor and horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/15469b246471293a7799b72a20dbf948.poster.avif?t=1755426511\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/15469b246471293a7799b72a20dbf948.webp?t=1755426511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your first day at work. Obey the pager to survive and climb the corporate ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/f896b3db6d62e0643050246538182b60.poster.avif?t=1755426511\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/f896b3db6d62e0643050246538182b60.webp?t=1755426511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-bit 3D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60  weird and beautiful  floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepares you for your next job.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caffeine-addicted butterflies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palette and glow  settings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/1e44c0504fcadf8897c2bae32b9f0c2f.poster.avif?t=1755426511\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/1e44c0504fcadf8897c2bae32b9f0c2f.webp?t=1755426511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by </strong>Severance, Franz Kafka, David Lynch, The Prisoner (1967), The Stanley Parable,\u00a0Sonny Boy,\u00a0Serial Experiments Lain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/53d5ee80e3ba978cb015ac5144743fd4.poster.avif?t=1755426511\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/53d5ee80e3ba978cb015ac5144743fd4.webp?t=1755426511\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you find it interesting! Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
